#: kalva.cpp:508
msgid ""
"<qt>If you are an experienced kde coder I want to invite you to take a close "
"look at Kalva's sources. Please through me a line if you know how to provide "
"immediate rebuilding the toolbar without loosing the actions load via "
"plugins...</qt>"
